## Menu Studio: `EDMINBOOST_Menu_Studio`

Not a feature module — registered in `EDMINBOOST_Plugin::run()`.

- `is_active()` — plugin enabled + resolved `menu_studio.enabled`.
- `get_settings()` — `EDMINBOOST_Command_Center::resolve_menu_studio_for_user()` (role preset + custom-item merge + visibility), not raw stored config.
- `get_custom_menu_slug( $id )` — returns `edminboost_ms_{sanitize_key(id)}`; use consistently for custom slugs in CC helpers and tests.
- `register_custom_items()` on `admin_menu` (99) — adds saved custom sidebar links (top-level and submenu).
- `apply_menu_changes()` on `admin_menu` (998) — reorders, hides, and nests submenus per saved config; `ensure_custom_items_in_menu()` appends registered custom top-level items missing from a rebuilt order.
- `enqueue_styles()` — when active, loads `edminboost-admin-menu.css` + inline CSS vars (layout/typography always; color vars when `use_colors`); display-mode body classes via `filter_body_class()`.
- `filter_body_class()` — adds `edminboost-menu-studio-active` (+ `edminboost-menu-studio-colors` when colors on; display-mode classes `edminboost-menu-studio-display--{both|icon|text}`).
- `get_protected_slugs()` — never hide or reorder away: `index.php`, `plugins.php`, `EDMINBOOST_Admin::PAGE_SLUG` (sanitizer strips these from `hidden_items`).
- Custom item path validation uses `~^[a-zA-Z0-9_\-\./?=&%#]+$~` (tilde delimiters — `#` is valid in admin paths/fragments).

## Visual Theme: `EDMINBOOST_Theme`

Not a feature module — registered in `EDMINBOOST_Plugin::run()`. Separate from `look_skin` (behavior bundles).

- `get_defaults()`, `get_presets()`, `get_modes()`, `get_fonts()`, `get_color_labels()`, `get_presets_for_js()`, `sanitize()` — preset/mode/font/custom color settings; also `font_size`, `admin_favicon_id`, `admin_bg_color`, `schedule_dark_mode`, post status color tokens.
- `resolve_preview_colors( $preset_id, $mode = 'light', $theme = null )` — resolved accent/surface/text/topbar/sidebar/content hex for preview UIs (Dashboard overview, theme picker, Productivity + Performance live previews); ignores active custom colors when previewing a different preset.
- `uses_custom_colors( $theme )` — true when `preset === 'custom'` or legacy `use_custom_colors` flag is set.
- `is_active()` — plugin enabled + logged in + (`is_admin()` **or** live CC bar / Layout Studio on front end).
- `register_hooks()` — body/admin body classes, `edminboost-themes.css`, inline custom color overrides via `print_custom_color_overrides()`.
- Body classes: `edminboost-theme-active`, `edminboost-theme--{preset}`, `edminboost-theme-mode--{mode}`, `edminboost-theme-font--{font}`.
- Preset catalog: `default`, `midnight`, `terminal`, `neon-outrun`, `vapor`, `desert`, `dracula`, `nord`, `solarized`, `sakura`, `ocean`, `forest`, `tron`, `night-city`, `pip-boy`, `portal`, `gotham`, `citadel`, `blade-noir`, `hyrule`, `custom` — each with five tokens: `accent`, `surface`, `text`, `topbar`, `sidebar`.
- CSS custom properties (`--eb-*`) drive plugin UI, CC bar, drawer, **and** core wp-admin `#wpadminbar` / `#adminmenu` when `body.edminboost-theme-active`.
- Menu Studio custom sidebar colors take precedence when `body.edminboost-menu-studio-colors` is present (`:not( .edminboost-menu-studio-colors )` guards in theme CSS).
- Custom preset: selecting `custom` reveals five color pickers + hex text fields; sanitizer sets `use_custom_colors` from preset (legacy checkbox input still maps to `custom`).
- No remote fonts — system font stacks only.

## White Label: `EDMINBOOST_White_Label`

Not a feature module — registered in `EDMINBOOST_Plugin::run()`. Config under `settings['white_label']`.

- `get_defaults()`, `get_settings()`, `sanitize()`, `is_active()` — branding + footer helpers.
- `get_plugin_header_defaults()` — plugin header + menu label fallbacks for empty rebranding fields and the live preview.
- `filter_admin_footer_text()` / `filter_update_footer()` — system status footer lines when enabled.
- `filter_plugin_row()` — rename plugin on Plugins screen; `filter_menu_label()` — rename EdminBoost menu item.
- `print_admin_favicon()` — admin favicon from `admin_logo_light_id` / `admin_logo_dark_id`.
- UI: `#edminboost_wl_enabled` master toggle; `#edminboost-wl-status-section` and `#edminboost-wl-rebrand-section` get `.is-disabled` until enabled (`initWhiteLabel` in admin JS).

## Rules

- Read settings via `EDMINBOOST_Command_Center::get_settings()` — not raw `get_option()`.
- System presets (scenario personas, per-role `system_role_{role}` workflow presets, and legacy `system_client` / `system_ecommerce` / `system_developer`) are read-only; custom presets live in `command_center.presets`.
- `role_assignments` stores preset IDs per role; first matching role applies preset top bar (`resolve_top_bar_items_for_user()`) and sidebar (`resolve_menu_studio_for_user()`).
- `role_visibility` stores hidden slugs per role (inverted from visible checkboxes in UI). Matrix lists every top-level menu item from `get_role_matrix_menu_items()` — including items hidden by Menu Studio. Items outside the assigned preset start unchecked but remain enabled; capability-restricted items also start unchecked (`.is-capability-restricted`). Protected slugs (Dashboard, Plugins, EdminBoost) stay checked and disabled.
- Mapper JS (`initMapper`) syncs visible canvas items to hidden inputs (`#edminboost-topbar-hidden-inputs`) before submit — includes `anchor` per item. `syncPanelBadgesVisibility()` enables `#edminboost-mapper-look` (Panel & badges) via `syncDependentSection()` only when at least one canvas item has `interaction === drawer`; server markup starts disabled.
- CC tab navigation JS (`initCommandCenterNav`): intercepts `.edminboost-cc-nav__link` clicks; waits for `pendingDashboardOverviewSave` when set; POSTs to `edminboostData.ccNav` (`edminboost_load_cc_page`); optional `form_defaults=1` re-renders with plugin defaults for form reset (read-only — no `update_option()`); swaps `.edminboost-wrap` HTML, updates `history.pushState`, calls `reinitEdminboostPage()`; falls back to full navigation on failure. Nav links use `data-edminboost-page` + `href` for deep links. AJAX tab loads call `ensure_discovery_menu_snapshot()` server-side (`prime_cc_page_context()`).
- Dashboard overview JS (`initDashboardOverview`): `#edminboost-dashboard-overview-form` — layout preset list click sets `#edminboost_dashboard_apply_preset` and AJAX-saves via `saveSettingsForm` (reload on success); theme preset list click updates `edminboostData.themeSettings`, syncs `#edminboost_theme_preset` + `syncThemeSettingsFn()` (live body preview), updates overview theme swatches, and silent AJAX-saves; read-only `#edminboost-overview-topbar-links-picker` lists configured links; live previews `#edminboost-overview-layout-preview`, `#edminboost-overview-layout-sidebar-preview`, `#edminboost-overview-theme-preview`, `#edminboost-overview-topbar-preview`.
- Mapper UX: discovered rows are draggable to canvas; row click toggles checkbox (except handle/toggle areas); canvas and shell accept drops; `is-active` on discovered rows mirrors canvas membership for items **without** an anchor (anchored/custom links do not toggle discovered checkboxes). Plugin search: `#edminboost-plugin-search` filters discovered list by label.
- Menu Studio JS (`initMenuStudio`): mirrors mapper patterns for sidebar — `#edminboost-menu-studio-form` (`data-edminboost-custom-items` JSON bootstrap), `#edminboost-menu-canvas`, `#edminboost-menu-discovered-list`, `#edminboost-menu-hidden-inputs`, custom link fields `#edminboost-menu-custom-*` (supports submenu parent); layout live preview `#edminboost-menu-layout-preview` synced from `#edminboost_menu_width`, `#edminboost_menu_font_size`, `#edminboost_menu_line_height`, `#edminboost_menu_letter_spacing`, `#edminboost_menu_display_mode` via `applyLayoutPreview()`; colors panel `#edminboost-menu-colors-panel` toggled by `#edminboost_menu_studio_use_colors`, live preview `#edminboost-menu-color-preview` via `applyColorPreview()` (also syncs layout preview; picker ↔ hex sync on `.edminboost-menu-color-row`; includes `submenu_hover_text`); marker `command_center[_menu_studio_save]` = `1`.
- Form reset JS (`initFormResetButtons`): `.edminboost-form-reset` in `.edminboost-form-actions` shows confirm notice, then reloads current tab with `form_defaults=1` via CC nav AJAX; server uses `EDMINBOOST_Settings::get_form_defaults()` through the `edminboost_settings` filter during render only — user must Save to persist.
- Theme JS (`initTheme`): preset dropdown / custom listbox `#edminboost-theme-preset-picker`, mode/font selects, live `#edminboost-theme-preview`; uses `edminboostData.themePresets` for swatch updates and body class preview (Appearance, setup wizard, and Dashboard overview via synced `#edminboost_theme_preset` + `syncThemeSettingsFn`). `updateThemePreview()` also refreshes Appearance extras (`syncThemeExtrasPreviewFn`) and declutter previews (`syncDeclutterPreviewThemeFn`) when present. AJAX save response `theme` key syncs `edminboostData.themeSettings` on non-dashboard forms.
- Theme extras JS (`initThemeExtras`): `#edminboost-theme-extras-preview` syncs font size (range + number), admin background color, favicon/background image IDs, post status row colors, and scheduled dark mode panel from Appearance extras fields; `#edminboost_schedule_dark_mode` toggles `.is-disabled` on `#edminboost-theme-schedule-options` via `syncDependentSection()`; exposes `syncThemeExtrasPreviewFn()` for preset/mode resync.
- Declutter preview JS (`initDeclutterPreview`): `#edminboost-declutter-preview` syncs `[data-preview]` items from declutter checkboxes via `syncDeclutterPreviewItem()` (`.is-hidden` when checked); exposes `syncDeclutterPreviewThemeFn()` for preset/mode color resync.
- Setup wizard JS (`initSetupWizard`): `#edminboost-setup-wizard-form`, stepper `.edminboost-setup-stepper__item`, steps `.edminboost-setup-step`, `#edminboost-setup-back` / `#edminboost-setup-next` / `#edminboost-setup-submit`; syncs layout preset radios to hidden `_apply_preset` / `default_preset`, renders top bar preview via `edminboostData.presets`; marker `command_center[_setup_wizard_save]` = `1`.
- Layout preset picker JS (`initLayoutPresetPicker`): custom listbox `#edminboost-layout-preset-picker` on setup wizard, Layout Presets page, and Dashboard overview; grouped options via `edminboostData.presetCategories`; live `.edminboost-overview-topbar-preview` and `.edminboost-overview-sidebar-preview` from `edminboostData.presets` (`sidebar_items`, `visible_top_level_menu_slugs`); `syncPresetCatalogFn` refreshes picker after AJAX save; duplicate/apply/save actions on Presets page stay in `initPresets`.
- Presets page JS (`initPresets` → `initRoleMatrix`): `.edminboost-role-matrix` syncs visibility checkboxes when `.edminboost-role-preset-select` changes; uses `edminboostData.roleMatrix` (`protectedSlugs`, `protectedSlugsByRole`, `accessibleSlugsByRole`) and preset `visible_top_level_menu_slugs`; `.is-not-in-layout` / `.is-capability-restricted` cell modifiers.
- Setting help (`EDMINBOOST_Setting_Help`): `echo_icon( $key )` beside field labels; hidden on Dashboard (`should_show()`); tooltip registry in `get_tooltips()`. Checkbox rows: icon before `<input>` inside `.edminboost-checkbox-row`. Grouped `<select>` fields: wrap in `.edminboost-select-rows` / `.edminboost-select-row`; register per-subfield keys when contexts differ (e.g. `heartbeat_admin`, `heartbeat_editor`, `heartbeat_frontend`).
- Behavior JS (`initBehaviorAnimationSpeed`): hidden `#edminboost_animation_speed` syncs with `.edminboost-animation-speed-picker` listbox; previews use `--edminboost-animation-preview-ms` per option; live drawer reads saved speed via `EDMINBOOST_Command_Center::get_animation_duration_ms()` → `edminboostCcBar.animationMs` and shell `--edminboost-cc-drawer-duration`.
- White Label JS (`initWhiteLabel`): `#edminboost_wl_enabled` toggles `.is-disabled` + `aria-disabled` on `#edminboost-wl-status-section` / `#edminboost-wl-rebrand-section`; live `#edminboost-wl-rebrand-preview` updates from plugin name, description, author, URI, and menu label inputs via `data-default-*` fallbacks.
- Security JS (`initSecurityFeatures`): `#edminboost_login_redirects_enabled` toggles `.is-disabled` + `aria-disabled` on `#edminboost-login-redirects-options` (`.edminboost-dependent-section`); uses shared `syncDependentSection()`.
- Productivity JS (`initProductivityFeatures`): `#edminboost-productivity-admin-notices-preview` syncs `[data-preview]` items from `#edminboost_hide_admin_notices` / `#edminboost_hide_screen_help` via `syncPerformancePreviewItem()`; `#edminboost_dashboard_widgets_enabled` / `#edminboost_admin_footer_enabled` toggle `.is-disabled` + `aria-disabled` on `#edminboost-dashboard-widgets-options` and `#edminboost-admin-footer-options` via `syncDependentSection()`.
- Performance JS (`initPerformanceFeatures`): `#edminboost-performance-emoji-preview` syncs admin/front-end panels from `#edminboost_disable_emojis_enabled` + `#edminboost_disable_emojis_scope`; `#edminboost-performance-assets-preview` syncs items from asset toggles (`remove_asset_versions`, `remove_dashicons_frontend`, `disable_embeds`); uses `syncPerformancePreviewItem()` for `.is-removed`, tooltips, and `aria-label`.
- Custom admin link: `#edminboost-custom-link-path`, `#edminboost-custom-link-label`, `#edminboost-custom-link-anchor` — path may include `#fragment`; duplicate check uses slug+anchor.
- Item drawer: `#edminboost-item-anchor` edits the selected canvas item's anchor; `#edminboost-drawer-preview` (visible when interaction is `drawer`) triggers AJAX preview via `edminboostCcOpenDrawer`.
- Badge sources (`wc_orders`, `comments`, `forms_entries`, etc.) are local counters only — no remote API calls.
